# A class that reads a memory combinationally (Driver/Inputs/deep) stays staged.
# RUN: cd %S/../Driver/Inputs/deep && foldsim --srcs top.f --top Top --out %t/comb --static --stage-levels 6 --multicycle Leaf Leaf > %t/comb.log 2>&1
# RUN: FileCheck %s --check-prefix=COMB < %t/comb.log
# Unstaged, the leaf's cone is one host cycle of 46 estimated levels; at 6
# levels a host cycle it spans 8 (the state passes 8 positions apart), at 4,
# 11; every path from the capture registers ends at the end registers and is
# judged per host cycle at no more than 6 levels, the rest at most 6.
# DEEP: #1 levels 46:
# M6: Leaf multicycle: {{[0-9]+}} half levels estimated, over 8 host cycles (estimated at 12 half levels a host cycle), state passes 8 positions apart
# M6: Leaf x4 state gap {{[0-9]+}} stages 9 multicycle 8
# M6: Leaf multicycle 8: {{[0-9]+}} capture bits ({{[0-9]+}} registers), {{[0-9]+}} end bits ({{[0-9]+}} registers)
# XDC: set_multicycle_path 8 -setup -from [get_cells -hierarchical -filter {IS_SEQUENTIAL && NAME =~ "*fsmc_Leaf__cap*"}] -to [get_cells -hierarchical -filter {IS_SEQUENTIAL && NAME =~ "*fsmc_Leaf__end*"}]
# XDC: set_multicycle_path 7 -hold -from [get_cells -hierarchical -filter {IS_SEQUENTIAL && NAME =~ "*fsmc_Leaf__cap*"}] -to [get_cells -hierarchical -filter {IS_SEQUENTIAL && NAME =~ "*fsmc_Leaf__end*"}]
# JSON: "prefix": "fsmc_Leaf__",
# JSON-NEXT: "cycles": 8,
# RAW6: #1 levels 46: /fsmc_Leaf__end{{[0-9]+}}.d[{{[0-9]+}}] (Leaf_static)
# JUDGE6: end points by levels per allowed host cycle: {{.*}} 6:{{[0-9]+}}{{$}}
# JUDGE6: at or above 7 levels per host cycle: 0
# JUDGE6-NOT: OUTSIDE
# M4: Leaf x4 state gap {{[0-9]+}} stages 12 multicycle 11
# G5: Leaf multicycle: {{[0-9]+}} half levels estimated, over 5 host cycles (given), state passes 5 positions apart
# G5: Leaf x4 state gap {{[0-9]+}} stages 6 multicycle 5
# XDC5: set_multicycle_path 5 -setup
# XDC5: set_multicycle_path 4 -hold
# COMB: Leaf reads a memory combinationally: staged, not multicycle
# COMB: Leaf x4 state gap 4 stages 9{{$}}
# CHECK: {{^}}MATCH 196 cycles
